{"id":923,"date":"2020-09-30T15:34:20","date_gmt":"2020-09-30T15:34:20","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/?post_type=rdrcnews&#038;p=923"},"modified":"2021-06-24T13:30:59","modified_gmt":"2021-06-24T13:30:59","slug":"summertime-the-plaza-concert-event-series","status":"publish","type":"rdrcnews","link":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/rdrcnews\/summertime-the-plaza-concert-event-series\/","title":{"rendered":"Summertime @The Plaza Concert &#038; Event Series w\/VJ Ralph McDaniels Video Music Box"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Hall of Fame Hip Hop VJ Ralph McDaniels Video Music Box<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Hang out &amp; Party Live w\/Hip Hop Hall of Fame\u00a0<span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a class=\"_e75a791d-denali-editor-page-rtfLink\" style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"http:\/\/videomusicbox.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">VJ Ralph McDaniels Video Music Box<\/a><\/span>, The Longest Running Music Video Show in the World; VJ Ralph McDaniels <strong>one hour and fifteen minutes<\/strong> of Hip Hop n Soul Sounds.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Check-in for our &#8220;Open Mic Contest&#8221; <\/span><\/span><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\">to receive a FREE Gift from #DowntownFarRockaway Businesses The Crate, &amp; D&#8217;Jeannette Boutique.<\/span>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">About Summertime @The Plaza Concert &amp; Event Series<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Summertime @The Plaza Concert &amp; Event Series is RDRC&#8217;s annual Neighborhood Community Event. We are bringing new styles and flavors of entertainment from Queens, the NYC Metropolitan area, and beyond our borders. The event includes visual art projects, live music, DJ&#8217;s, spoken word performances, and video projections; that is family-friendly entertainment.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">This year, due to COVID-19, we will be hosting Virtual entertainment, inclusion with <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/rockawaydevrevcorp\/photos\/pcb.766199707561944\/766199477561967\">Diversity Plaza 37th Road<\/a><\/span>; a volunteer group RDRC has partnered with through grant winnings from <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/cityparksfoundation.org\/nyc-green-fund\/\">NYC Green Relief &amp; Recovery Fund<\/a><\/span>. Our next virtual event will be, <strong>Friday, October 2nd 6pm to 7:15pm<\/strong> with our very own Queens Hip Hop Life-Time Achievement Recipient, Ralph McDaniels, Video Music Box, with Open Mic engagement from Queens artists. We invite all to attend. RSVP to <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"mailto:communityrelations@rdrc.org\">communityrelations@rdrc.org<\/a><\/span> for <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/1M3BXZ3-CP6BR5NcBXrK1hV_RxSfyQopQ\/view?fbclid=IwAR1ehP3uAwx7MkvHC-zcXRV0mvis1wk0_Q-vis9W7Q261sF8Sw5kRFL6evI\">Summertime @ThePlaza Concert &amp; Event Series<\/a>, <span style=\"color: #000080;\">or join day of via Zoom<\/span> <a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/zoom.us\/j\/94609767230?pwd=R0p5N2FKai9pREVGWWVQazhrbU13UT09\">Here<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">#RDRC #Summertime@B20thStPlaza #DowntownFarRockaway #TheRockaways #VideoMusicBox #RalphMcDaniels #ItsInQueens<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Hall of Fame Hip Hop VJ Ralph McDaniels Video Music Box Hang out &amp; Party Live w\/Hip Hop Hall of Fame\u00a0VJ Ralph McDaniels Video Music Box, The Longest Running Music Video Show in the World; VJ Ralph McDaniels one hour and fifteen minutes of Hip Hop n Soul Sounds.\u00a0 Check-in for our &#8220;Open Mic Contest&#8221; [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","pr